This kit adapts parts of Matt Pocock's skills (https://github.com/mattpocock/skills),
rewritten in the kit's own words:

- .agents/skills/diagnose/SKILL.md
  from skills/engineering/diagnosing-bugs
- .agents/skills/build/SKILL.md (step 5, the red, green, refactor loop) and guide/testing.md
  from skills/engineering/tdd
- .agents/skills/back/SKILL.md (the Retro section) and .agents/skills/afk/SKILL.md (the hard stop)
  from skills/engineering/retro
- .agents/skills/writing-for-agents/SKILL.md
  from skills/productivity/writing-for-agents
- stacks/tanstack-start/scripts/connect.mjs and scripts/connect/ (`pnpm connect`), and the
  connect blocks in .agents/skills/secrets/ (SKILL.md and providers/)
  from skills/engineering/wizard

Copies of these files in .claude/skills/, plugin/ and the CLI's bundled kit carry the same parts.

